				},
				{
					"id": 80120602,
					"content": "卡利貝爾！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120603,
					"content": "找到了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80120604,
					"content": "卡利貝爾，別往前走了，是我，是爸爸！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120605,
					"content": "不管你看到了什麼，那些…那些都是幻覺，都是騙你的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120606,
					"content": "爸爸說過了，這裡是童話的世界，不是真的。來，快過來，跟我一起回去！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120607,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡利貝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120608,
					"content": "卡利貝爾？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120609,
						80120610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120609,
					"content": "沒有反應…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120611
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80120611,
					"content": "怎麼回事，他應該已經恢復神智了啊？應該聽得懂我說話啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120612,
					"content": "喂，卡利貝爾，我們回家吧，一起回家，好嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120613,
						80120614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120613,
					"content": "等等，他的狀態好像有點不太對…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80120615,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡利貝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120614,
					"content": "難道說是那種力量的影響…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80120610,
					"content": "像最初的時候一樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120611
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 801207,
